{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>&quot;Vaca Bullet&quot;</strong> you will step into the shoes of a cowboy in the Wild West, who must defend his vacas(cows) from the dreaded bullets of bandits trying to steal them. This game is a tribute to those <strong>&quot;Western&quot;</strong> movies, full of shootouts and chases, all achieved through beautiful pixel art that seeks to give it a raw and unique essence like a true western.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo of &quot;Vaca Bullet&quot;, you'll be able to play the first 5 levels that the full version offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A frenetic pixel art game set in the Old West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short game full of fast and addictive shootouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn and easy-to-use controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 types of weapons.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752390?t=1748539105","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752390?t=1748539105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752390/2a089f0a048c1be20c8139e361b6a0be05adcf9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748539105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752390/2a089f0a048c1be20c8139e361b6a0be05adcf9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748539105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>&quot;Vaca Bullet&quot;</strong> you will step into the shoes of a cowboy in the Wild West, who must defend his vacas(cows) from the dreaded bullets of bandits trying to steal 